    "Include screenshots in automatic backup and Back Up Now. When off, screenshots stay in your gallery and can still be selected for manual backup. The upload size limit is off by default. It applies to each request, including form data, for automatic and manual backup. For a 100 MB proxy limit, 95 MB leaves room for variation. Files over the limit show an exclusion icon and are not uploaded from this device. If a server copy is confirmed, they show the backed-up cloud. Transfers already in progress may finish.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Include screenshots in automatic backup and Back Up Now. When off, screenshots stay in your gallery and can still be selected for manual backup. The upload size limit is off by default. It applies to each request, including form data, for automatic and manual backup. For a 100 MB proxy limit, 95 MB leaves room for variation. Files over the limit show an exclusion icon and are not uploaded from this device. If a server copy is confirmed, they show the backed-up cloud. Transfers already in progress may finish."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动备份和“立即备份”包含截屏。关闭后，截屏仍保留在图库中，您也可以选择手动备份。上传大小限制默认关闭，适用于自动和手动备份的每个请求，包含表单数据。若代理限制为 100 MB，设置为 95 MB 可留出余量。超过限制的文件会显示排除图标，不会从此设备上传。若已确认服务器上有副本，则会显示已备份的云朵图标。正在进行的传输可能仍会完成。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Imora/Features/Backup/BackupScreen.swift:152"
    },
    "Indexing %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indexing %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在为%@建立索引"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Imora/Core/Backup/BackupManager.swift:2888"
    },
    "Indexing and uploads pause at this battery level, including while charging. Sync This Time allows backup until the battery rises above the threshold. The metered-connection override ends when an unmetered connection is available. Transfers already handed to iOS may finish while backup is paused.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indexing and uploads pause at this battery level, including while charging. Sync This Time allows backup until the battery rises above the threshold. The metered-connection override ends when an unmetered connection is available. Transfers already handed to iOS may finish while backup is paused."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电量达到此阈值时，索引和上传将暂停，充电时也不例外。“本次仍同步”可允许备份继续，直到电量高于阈值。允许使用按流量计费连接的临时设置会在连接到不按流量计费的网络后结束。备份暂停时，已交给 iOS 的传输仍可能完成。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Imora/Features/Backup/BackupScreen.swift:177"
    },
