    "More indexing workers may be faster but use more memory, battery, and iCloud bandwidth. Ordering controls which photos and videos are indexed and queued first. Your backup exclusions still apply, and new captures keep priority. Changes apply to the next pass.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "More indexing workers may be faster but use more memory, battery, and iCloud bandwidth. Ordering controls which photos and videos are indexed and queued first. Your backup exclusions still apply, and new captures keep priority. Changes apply to the next pass."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时处理更多索引任务可能加快速度，但也会占用更多内存、电量和 iCloud 流量。排序设置决定先为哪些照片和视频建立索引并加入上传队列。备份排除设置仍然有效，新拍摄的项目也会保持优先。更改将在下一轮处理时生效。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Imora/Features/Backup/BackupScreen.swift:213"
    },
