    "On Wi-Fi, Imora checks the server against this saved certificate before using the local address. It does not need the Wi-Fi name. Automatic mode uses the external address when the verified local server is unavailable. Manual local mode stays selected and never switches to the external address.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On Wi-Fi, Imora checks the server against this saved certificate before using the local address. It does not need the Wi-Fi name. Automatic mode uses the external address when the verified local server is unavailable. Manual local mode stays selected and never switches to the external address."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接 Wi-Fi 时，Imora 会先使用此已保存的证书验证服务器，再使用局域网地址，无需读取 Wi-Fi 名称。自动模式会在已验证的局域网服务器不可用时使用外网地址。手动局域网模式会保持选中，不会自动切换到外网地址。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Imora/Features/Settings/LocalNetworkScreen.swift:149"
