    "People will be recognized across the photos of everyone in the group. Your names and birth dates are not shared. To apply this to photos you already have, facial recognition must be reset for the group, which deletes its people along with their names and birth dates.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "People will be recognized across the photos of everyone in the group. Your names and birth dates are not shared. To apply this to photos you already have, facial recognition must be reset for the group, which deletes its people along with their names and birth dates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统会对群组所有成员的照片进行统一人脸识别。您设置的姓名和出生日期不会共享。若要对现有照片应用此功能，需要重置群组的人脸识别，这会删除群组的人物及其姓名和出生日期。"
          }
        }
      },
